PHASE H – FIRST START / HCP VALIDATION [L3/L2; L3 owns decision]

H1. Start [L3/L2]:

Do not enable production traffic yet.

H2. Verify [L3/L2]: q status q db f=d q log f=d q process q stgpool f=d
