Successful HCP validation is mandatory. Failure = NO-GO.

PHASE I – POST METADATA RECONCILIATION [L3/L2; L3 owns Go/No-Go]

Production remains blocked.

I1. POST total [L3/L2]: select count(*) as TOTAL_ARCHIVES from archives

